BT 1 0 0 1 0 68.208 Tm 19.952 TL /F6 11.6 Tf .129412 .117647 .098039 rg (The title.) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( The Latin word ) Tj /F5 11.6 Tf (confessio) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( means three things at once: confessing sin, confessing) Tj T* (faith, and confessing praise. Modern English kept only the first. The book is not a list of) Tj T* (misdeeds. It is a prayer, addressed to God from the first word to the last. You are not the) Tj T* (person being spoken to. You are overhearing.) Tj T* ET
