BT 1 0 0 1 0 88.16 Tm /F1 11.6 Tf 19.952 TL (One warning specific to this part. Book Two is about a teenager\222s sexual awakening and Book) Tj T* (Three opens with a line about a city seething with lust. Augustine\222s language here is heated,) Tj T* (and it has been used for sixteen centuries to support positions about sex that he may or may) Tj T* (not have held. I will describe what the text says, note where his own wording is doing) Tj T* (rhetorical work, and not tell you what to conclude from it.) Tj T* ET
