BT 1 0 0 1 0 68.208 Tm 19.952 TL /F6 11.6 Tf .129412 .117647 .098039 rg (The man.) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( Born 354 in Thagaste, a small town in Roman North Africa, in what is now Algeria.) Tj T* (Clever, ambitious, and educated at his family\222s considerable expense towards a career as a) Tj T* (professional public speaker. He wrote this book in his early forties, around 397 to 400,) Tj T* (roughly twenty years after the events in this part.) Tj T* ET
