BT 1 0 0 1 0 128.064 Tm 19.952 TL /F1 11.6 Tf .129412 .117647 .098039 rg (Six kinds of box run through this series. ) Tj /F6 11.6 Tf (Word Box) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( explains a hard term the moment it first) Tj T* (appears. ) Tj /F6 11.6 Tf (In Real Terms) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( turns a number or a distance into something you can picture. ) Tj /F6 11.6 Tf (How) Tj T* (We Actually Know This) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( names the physical evidence and says what it cannot show. ) Tj /F6 11.6 Tf (The) Tj T* (Argument) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( is for places where experts genuinely disagree, and gives each side its strongest) Tj T* (case rather than a version built to be knocked down. ) Tj /F6 11.6 Tf (The Hidden Assumption) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( digs out the) Tj T* (premise everybody in an argument is quietly taking for granted. ) Tj /F6 11.6 Tf (Remember This) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( closes every) Tj T* (chapter in the plainest words available.) Tj T* ET
