BT 1 0 0 1 0 108.112 Tm 19.952 TL /F6 11.6 Tf .129412 .117647 .098039 rg (The story so far.) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( Nine years with the Manichees, a religion teaching two eternal powers of) Tj T* (Light and Darkness, which had the advantage of answering the question of where evil comes) Tj T* (from and the further advantage of making his own wrongdoing not really his. It collapsed. He) Tj T* (drifted through scepticism to Milan, where the bishop Ambrose showed him that scripture) Tj T* (could be read figuratively and that the church did not teach the crude doctrines he had spent) Tj T* (a decade attacking.) Tj T* ET
