q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 48.256 Tm 19.952 TL /F6 11.6 Tf .129412 .117647 .098039 rg (And he could not hold it.) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( That is the whole of Book Eight. He knows the answer. He cannot) Tj T* -0.001095 Tw (move. Part Four ended by promising that the gap between seeing an answer and being able to) Tj T* 0 Tw (live in it is what this part is about.) Tj T* ET
