BT 1 0 0 1 0 108.112 Tm 19.952 TL /F1 11.6 Tf .129412 .117647 .098039 rg (Six kinds of box run through this series. ) Tj /F6 11.6 Tf (Word Box) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( explains a hard term the moment it first) Tj T* (appears. ) Tj /F6 11.6 Tf (In Real Terms) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( turns something abstract into something you can picture. ) Tj /F6 11.6 Tf (How We) Tj T* (Actually Know This) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( names the evidence and says what it cannot show. ) Tj /F6 11.6 Tf (The Argument) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( is for) Tj T* (places where experts genuinely disagree, and gives each side its strongest case. ) Tj /F6 11.6 Tf (The Hidden) Tj T* (Assumption) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( digs out the premise everybody is quietly taking for granted. ) Tj /F6 11.6 Tf (Remember This) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf  T* (closes every chapter in the plainest words available.) Tj T* ET
