q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 68.208 Tm 19.952 TL /F6 11.6 Tf .129412 .117647 .098039 rg (Two. The problem has changed shape.) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( Books One to Seven were about not knowing. Book) Tj T* (Eight is about knowing and not doing, which is a different problem and, on Augustine\222s) Tj T* (account, a much worse one. Everything he writes about the will for the next forty years starts) Tj T* (here.) Tj T* ET
