BT 1 0 0 1 0 68.208 Tm 19.952 TL /F6 11.6 Tf .129412 .117647 .098039 rg (The man.) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( Born 354 in Roman North Africa, educated at his family\222s expense towards a career) Tj T* (as a professional public speaker. By 384 he held the public chair of rhetoric in Milan, the city) Tj T* (where the western emperor lived. He wrote this book in his early forties, around 397 to 400,) Tj T* (about eleven years after the events in it.) Tj T* ET
