BT 1 0 0 1 0 88.16 Tm -0.148394 Tw 19.952 TL /F6 11.6 Tf .129412 .117647 .098039 rg (One. Almost nothing dramatic happens, and everything changes.) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( Book Eight has a garden,) Tj T* 0 Tw (a voice and a famous scene. Book Nine has a resignation timed to the school holidays, a) Tj T* (country house, a toothache, a font, a window and a funeral. If you have been reading this) Tj T* (series for the arguments, this is the part where the arguments get quieter and the stakes get) Tj T* (higher.) Tj T* ET
