BT 1 0 0 1 0 88.16 Tm 19.952 TL /F6 11.6 Tf .129412 .117647 .098039 rg (Two. This is the part where other people finally get room.) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( Verecundus, Nebridius,) Tj T* (Adeodatus, Evodius, Navigius and above all Monica are given more space here than anywhere) Tj T* (else in the book. Four of the thirteen sections are about his mother. That is a deliberate act by) Tj T* -0.013863 Tw (a writer who has spent eight books on himself, and Chapter Six is about what he is doing with) Tj T* 0 Tw (it.) Tj T* ET
