BT 1 0 0 1 0 68.208 Tm 19.952 TL /F6 11.6 Tf .129412 .117647 .098039 rg (Three. He breaks his own rule and knows it.) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( Part Three reported his verdict that grief for) Tj T* (the dead is a fault. In this book his mother dies, he fights his tears all day, he loses, he is) Tj T* (ashamed of losing, and then he is ashamed of the shame. Chapter Nine reports that sequence) Tj T* (exactly and does not tidy it up, because the untidiness is the evidence.) Tj T* ET
