BT 1 0 0 1 0 68.208 Tm -0.076652 Tw 19.952 TL /F6 11.6 Tf .129412 .117647 .098039 rg (The man.) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( Born 354 in Roman North Africa, trained as a professional public speaker, professor) Tj T* 0 Tw (of rhetoric at Milan by 384. He resigned in 386 after the conversion described in Book Eight,) Tj T* (was baptised in 387, buried his mother at Ostia that autumn, went home to Africa, and was) Tj T* (made bishop of Hippo in his early forties. He wrote this book around 397 to 400.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 59.52756 569.2423 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 28.304 Tm 19.952 TL /F6 11.6 Tf .129412 .117647 .098039 rg (The book.) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( Thirteen books. ) Tj /F5 11.6 Tf (Confessio) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( means confessing sin, confessing faith and confessing) Tj T* (praise, all at once. It is a prayer, addressed to God throughout, and you are overhearing it.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 59.52756 482.9343 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 68.208 Tm 19.952 TL /F6 11.6 Tf .129412 .117647 .098039 rg (Where the story ended.) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( Books One to Nine are the life, and they finish at a graveside in 387.) Tj T* (Book Ten then skips eleven years and turns the same attention on the man holding the pen:) Tj T* (what a person is, what memory contains, what he is still tempted by. Part Seven covered it,) Tj T* (and the two things to carry forward from it are these.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 59.52756 396.6263 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 68.208 Tm 19.952 TL /F6 11.6 Tf .129412 .117647 .098039 rg (One: memory is not a record of the past.) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( Augustine\222s ) Tj /F5 11.6 Tf (memoria) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( holds recollections, but it) Tj T* (also holds mathematics, skills, emotions you are not currently feeling, and the fact that you) Tj T* (have forgotten things. It is the whole standing content of a mind. Book Eleven is going to use) Tj T* (that, and the argument does not work without it.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 59.52756 330.2703 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 48.256 Tm 19.952 TL /F6 11.6 Tf .129412 .117647 .098039 rg (Two: he cannot get to the bottom of himself.) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( Book Ten ends with the mind unable to take) Tj T* (in the whole of what it is. That is the unfinished business Book Eleven inherits, and it is why) Tj T* (the next question is not \223what am I\224 but \223what is time\224.) Tj T* ET
