BT 1 0 0 1 0 68.208 Tm 19.952 TL /F6 11.6 Tf .129412 .117647 .098039 rg (One. This is where Augustine stops being a theologian people quote and becomes a) Tj T* (philosopher people argue with.) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( Book Eleven is on reading lists in departments with no) Tj T* (interest in anything else he wrote. The question it asks has not been closed, and the people) Tj T* (still working on it are not doing theology.) Tj T* ET
