q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 68.208 Tm 19.952 TL /F6 11.6 Tf .129412 .117647 .098039 rg (Two. He answers his own question.) Tj /F1 11.6 Tf ( The famous line \227 if nobody asks me I know, if I have) Tj T* (to explain it I do not \227 is quoted everywhere as a charming shrug. It is not a shrug. It is the) Tj T* (setup, and the argument runs for another fifteen sections and arrives somewhere. Chapter) Tj T* (Seven is where it lands.) Tj T* ET
